selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b7ea6678-6624-5853-b137-be255a3e694e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163229"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection/2dfccb905a6bd56c841c6314185162ba105ffe30fed4b197c10b2dd48ba7b0d2" :answer/id #uuid "482ea3d0-33e9-586b-8c23-49b74840a63a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "21\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection/fe90678e55592d4eedc410d402f207331ca2cd8c380014171a78472a1e8a8c88" :answer/id #uuid "173da55b-110a-523f-8dae-32620208a66d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection/18ab5e12d161d47c9753ecf979c76674bac07ca32efa956cedeb5dbfc29f12ed" :answer/id #uuid "e8e7e784-a95b-527e-908e-111a7bc1af92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection/8b35867216dd9ffd193571cbe0b3c9c5fa0c23e4e363799ab3fe35e362a90dad" :answer/id #uuid "535d7f4b-5e22-520b-acda-878ec40d8147" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "19\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection/2d3636214325310dd02231ec03a556f7efe5e73986e90e2cd03eeb749baae693" :answer/id #uuid "04eb5dbf-cd20-5442-870e-c12448d49851" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "03176b14-54a7-5c76-9b3d-8b33bb9879a2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-163223/selection/8b35867216dd9ffd193571cbe0b3c9c5fa0c23e4e363799ab3fe35e362a90dad" :answer-field/choices ["q-163223/selection/2dfccb905a6bd56c841c6314185162ba105ffe30fed4b197c10b2dd48ba7b0d2" "q-163223/selection/fe90678e55592d4eedc410d402f207331ca2cd8c380014171a78472a1e8a8c88" "q-163223/selection/18ab5e12d161d47c9753ecf979c76674bac07ca32efa956cedeb5dbfc29f12ed" "q-163223/selection/8b35867216dd9ffd193571cbe0b3c9c5fa0c23e4e363799ab3fe35e362a90dad" "q-163223/selection/2d3636214325310dd02231ec03a556f7efe5e73986e90e2cd03eeb749baae693"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-163223" :question/id #uuid "403f8db4-df11-5433-9d6b-c89966b6432c" :question/math-academy-id "q-163223" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033857/assets/6a3454379845a4202407ec16df4dee2cf31d0c67260952dd9a1cb07d48f7b936.png)\n\nConsider the collection of point masses shown above, where the distances along the $x$-axis are measured in meters. Find the total moment of this system about the origin." :question/worked-solution "The moment about the origin $O$ of a collection of masses ${m}_{1},{m}_{2},…,{m}_{n}$ located at ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ along the $x$-axis is given by \n\n$$\n{M}_{O}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{m}_{i}{x}_{i}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{1} & =3, & \\,{m}_{2} & =2, & \\,{m}_{3} & =1.5, & \\,{m}_{4} & =1, \\\\ {x}_{1} & =1, & \\,{x}_{2} & =2, & \\,{x}_{3} & =4, & \\,{x}_{4} & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate the total moment of this system about the origin as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{O} & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{m}_{i}{x}_{i} \\\\  & ={m}_{1}{x}_{1}+{m}_{2}{x}_{2}+{m}_{3}{x}_{3}+{m}_{4}{x}_{4} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 2+1.5\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =3+4+6+6 \\\\  & =19\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the total moment of the system is $19\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-163223/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b7ea6678-6624-5853-b137-be255a3e694e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163223"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163187/selection/2d3636214325310dd02231ec03a556f7efe5e73986e90e2cd03eeb749baae693" :answer/id