d "4d5de849-8db4-5330-9f8f-b2d802a64b63" :question/math-academy-id "q-163187" :question/problem "Consider the collection of point masses ${m}_{1}=5\\,\\text{kg},$ ${m}_{2}=1\\,\\text{kg},$ and ${m}_{3}=4\\,\\text{kg}$ located at ${x}_{1}=1\\,\\text{m},$ ${x}_{2}=1.5\\,\\text{m},$ and ${x}_{3}=3\\,\\text{m},$ respectively, along the $x$-axis. Find the total moment of this system about the origin." :question/worked-solution "The moment about the origin $O$ of a collection of masses ${m}_{1},{m}_{2},…,{m}_{n}$ located at ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ along the $x$-axis is given by \n\n$$\n{M}_{O}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{m}_{i}{x}_{i}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{1} & =5, & \\,{m}_{2} & =1, & \\,{m}_{3} & =4, \\\\ {x}_{1} & =1, & \\,{x}_{2} & =1.5, & \\,{x}_{3} & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate the total moment of this system about the origin as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{O} & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{m}_{i}{x}_{i} \\\\  & ={m}_{1}{x}_{1}+{m}_{2}{x}_{2}+{m}_{3}{x}_{3} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 1.5+4\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =5+1.5+12 \\\\  & =18.5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the total moment of the system is $18.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-163187/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b7ea6678-6624-5853-b137-be255a3e694e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163187"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163226/selection/4e077343e079dd4aba5fb6e41a52f9fec8fb22c55cf9aa81cb767cf81e5a6874" :answer/id #uuid "b5027a93-273f-5ded-8481-be1d614b2480" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163226/selection/704b0ac0232fcfbabe16992ccc67ef4d27688cc51f2ddda247c132db0c7a9a92" :answer/id #uuid "99147cd8-3053-5f9b-874d-5580978a0cf1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot \\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/i